Disable clang optimization for synchronizer.cpp to prevent miscompilation
of ObjectSynchronizer::inflate on musl. Clang merges the neutral/locked
CAS paths incorrectly, causing SIGSEGV.

--- a/hotspot/src/share/vm/runtime/synchronizer.cpp
+++ b/hotspot/src/share/vm/runtime/synchronizer.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#pragma clang optimize off
